I understand the situation. The menu structure for the profile dropdown is correct, so the issue likely lies in the CSS or JavaScript controlling its visibility. Let's focus on the CSS rules for the dropdown-menu class, particularly for the profile menu. We can try adding specific styles to ensure the profile dropdown is visible and properly positioned. Here's a suggestion for CSS modifications:

```css
.navbar-nav .dropdown-menu {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
    background-color: #4A2C2A;
    border: 1px solid #CD1520;
    z-index: 1000;
}

